# __NAME__

TypeScript CLI on Bun. One bin entry at `src/bin.ts`; new code goes into `src/types/`, `src/const/` or `src/funcs/`.

## Commands

- Install: `__PACKAGE_MANAGER__ install`
- Run: `bun src/bin.ts`
- Test: `bun test`
- Typecheck: `bun run typecheck` (typechecker `__TYPECHECKER__`)
- Lint: `bun run lint` (linter `__LINTER__`)
- Format: `bun run format` (formatter `__FORMATTER__`)

Tabs at 4 wide, printWidth 100. `jyz.config.toml` holds the toolchain choice; edit it rather than the tool configs.
